#X text 82 4622 drv (0): overdrive (not on the Poly-800) \, soft clipping \, 0-127 = 0-48 dB more gain with level makeup. \; drvp (0): 0 post: after the VCF \, denser with res and chords \, 1 pre: into the VCF \, which rounds the distortion off (warmer)., f 64;
#X obj 460 4714 s \$0-pdoly8;
#X floatatom 60 4690 6 0 127 0 - - -;
#X msg 60 4714 vcut \$1;
#X text 82 4744 vcut (0): velocity to the cutoff: at 127 a soft key is up to 5 octaves lower \, full velocity plays the cut set (one VCF: the last key counts)., f 64;
#X obj 60 4806 cnv 10 10 10 empty empty MG\ settings 24 6 0 14 #1e3791 #000000 0;
#X text 82 4834 One triangle MG for the instrument \, measured on a Poly-800 II. It also drives hmg \, pwm1/2 \, wsm and swm (DCO settings). More LFOs: LFO2 and LFO3 below., f 64;
#X obj 460 4910 s \$0-pdoly8;
#X floatatom 60 4886 6 -1 15 0 - - -;
#X msg 60 4910 mgr \$1;
#X floatatom 160 4886 6 0 30 0 - - -;
#X msg 160 4910 mgf \$1;
#X text 82 4940 mgr (-1): frequency in steps 0-15 as parameter 81 (0: 0.29 Hz / 3: 1.26 / 8: 5.2 / 15: 19 Hz) \, sets mgf. -1 = use mgf. \; mgf (5): the same in Hz., f 64;
#X obj 460 5016 s \$0-pdoly8;
