#X text 82 5184 mgv (0): MG to the VCF 0-15 (84: +-7.9 octaves at 15)., f 64;
#X obj 60 5214 cnv 10 10 10 empty empty DEG4\ settings 24 6 0 14 #1e3791 #000000 0;
#X text 82 5242 A modulation envelope (not on the Poly-800) \, one for all voices like DEG3. The Poly-800 is paraphonic: every voice has its own DEG1 / DEG2 \, but the VCF \, DEG3 and the MG exist once - and so do DEG4 \, LFO2 and LFO3. Each of them has two target slots: t = target (number or name \, e.g. d4t1 cut) \, a = amount -127..127 (negative inverts)., f 64;
