#X text 82 5696 d4t1 \, d4a1 \, d4t2 \, d4a2: two targets and amounts. E.g. cut with a pluck (filter sweep per key) \, swe with sync 1 (sync sweep) \, fm1 (FM that decays) \, l2d (an LFO2 that comes in). \;   \; Targets (number name: parameter \, range at amount 127): \; 0 off: no target \; 1 pitch: pitch \, both DCOs +-24 semitones \; 2 pitch2: pitch DCO2 +-48 semitones \; 3 detn: detune DCO2 +-50 cents \; 4 har1: timbre DCO1 +-127 steps \; 5 har2: timbre DCO2 +-127 steps \; 6 wsh1: Walsh position DCO1 +-127 steps \; 7 wsh2: Walsh position DCO2 +-127 steps \; 8 wmx1: Walsh mix DCO1 +-127 \; 9 wmx2: Walsh mix DCO2 +-127 \; 10 pw1: pulse width DCO1 +-47 % \; 11 pw2: pulse width DCO2 +-47 % \; 12 fm1: FM depth DCO1 +-16 index \; 13 fm2: FM depth DCO2 +-16 index \; 14 fmr: FM ratio x/: 4 \; 15 ring: ring modulation amount +-127 \; 16 swe: sync sweep depth +-72 semitones \; 17 lev1: level DCO1 +-127 \; 18 lev2: level DCO2 +-127 \; 19 amp: output level x 0..2 (tremolo) \; 20 pan: balance left / right \; 21 nois: noise level +-15 \; 22 cut: cutoff filter +-8 octaves \; 23 res: resonance filter +-15 \; 24 drv: overdrive +-127 \; 25 mgr: MG rate x/: 8 \; 26 mgi: MG pitch depth +-200 cents \; 27 l2r: LFO2 rate x/: 8 \; 28 l2d: LFO2 depth x 0..2 \; 29 l3r: LFO3 rate x/: 8 \; 30 l3d: LFO3 depth x 0..2 \; 31 dtim: delay time x/: 2 \; 32 dlev: delay level +-15 \; har \, wsh \, wmx \, lev \, detn and drv follow per audio block (smoothed by mrph) \, all others per sample., f 64;
#X obj 60 6350 cnv 10 10 10 empty empty LFO2\ &\ LFO3\ settings 24 6 0 14 #1e3791 #000000 0;
